We start with a phrase. my $phrase = "the quick brown fox";
and keep a copy. my $copy = !-1;
we replace brown with red. $phrase =~ s/brown/red/;
and count the vowels. my $vowels = ($phrase =~ tr/aeiou//);
then we print the phrase and the count. print "$phrase\n";
print "vowels: $vowels\n";
and show the saved copy. print "again: ", !-2, "\n";
